            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit that had any damage points allocated to it this phase by this unit&apos;s shooting attacks to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. If the roll equals or exceeds the target&apos;s Save characteristic, halve the target&apos;s Move characteristic until the start of your next turn. In addition, on a 5+, until the start of your next turn, subtract 1 from the number of dice rolled when making charge rolls for the target, to a minimum of 1.</characteristic>
