            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick this unit and up to 2 friendly **Frost Sabres** units in this unit&apos;s regiment if none of those units have been deployed.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Set up those units in reserve **outflanking the prey**. They have now been deployed.</characteristic>
