                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If any visible friendly units had any damage points allocated to them this turn, roll a dice. Add 1 to the roll if any damage points were allocated to this unit this phase. On a 4+, this unit can move up to 2D6&quot;. It can move through the combat ranges of enemy units but cannot end that move in combat.</characteristic>
